From: opi5 <noreply@example.invalid>
Date: Sat, 8 Aug 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] media: rockchip: add vendor MPP service

The MPP service (rk_vcodec.ko): sessions, ioctls, dma-buf, IOMMU. Changed
from the vendor code:
- no dma-buf-cache header (optional; plain dma-buf references are used)
- MPP_VERSION is fixed instead of read from git at build time
- runtime PM instead of the private PMU idle hint
- IOMMU refresh reattaches the generic domain

Origin: https://github.com/rockchip-linux/kernel b4ef083dc0c3 (develop-6.1)
